    "created_at": "2022-06-15T08:39:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-15T08:39:41Z",
    "body": "> So the result here is that for synchronous XMLHttpRequest we don't create a timing entry, right?\r\n\r\nNo, there is no behavioral change. In sync XHR the task that reports the timing would run on the parallel queue, but that's immaterial because the main-thread queue is waiting on it anyway.",
